{
  "name": "Pipevideo — Rendu terminé → Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "pipevideo-rendu-termine",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-entree",
      "name": "Webhook rendu terminé",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -540,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "pipevideo-rendu-termine",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REMPLACER",
          "name": "x-webhook-secret pipevideo"
        }
      },
      "notes": "L'URL de production de ce nœud est la valeur à mettre dans N8N_RENDER_DONE_URL côté pipevideo. Authentification Header Auth : nom 'x-webhook-secret', valeur = N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET. Attention : l'URL /webhook-test/ ne vit que pendant une exécution manuelle — utiliser /webhook/ et activer le workflow."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a-un-chat",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.telegramChatId }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "est-reussi",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.status }}",
              "rightValue": "COMPLETED"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "reussi",
      "name": "Réussi et Telegram connu ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -320,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Un appel sans telegramChatId (déclenché hors Telegram) n'a personne à prévenir : il sort par la branche fausse."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.body.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "=✅ *{{ $json.body.title }}*\n\nLa vidéo est prête, rendue en {{ Math.floor($json.body.durationSeconds / 60) }} min {{ $json.body.durationSeconds % 60 }} s.\n\n{{ $json.body.videoUrl }}\n\nRegarde-la, puis réponds *publier* si elle te convient.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "envoyer-lien",
      "name": "Envoyer le lien",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REMPLACER",
          "name": "Bot Telegram Pipevideo"
        }
      },
      "notes": "L'URL R2 est publique et directement lisible. Le mot « publier » n'est pas encore branché : la publication YouTube fera l'objet d'un second workflow, une fois cette chaîne validée."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a-un-chat-echec",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.telegramChatId }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "echec-a-un-chat",
      "name": "Échec : Telegram connu ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -100,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.body.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "=❌ *{{ $json.body.title }}*\n\nLe rendu a échoué après {{ Math.floor($json.body.durationSeconds / 60) }} min.\n\n`{{ $json.body.error }}`\n\nLe storyboard est conservé : relancer ne repasse pas par DeepSeek.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "envoyer-echec",
      "name": "Signaler l'échec",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        120,
        420
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REMPLACER",
          "name": "Bot Telegram Pipevideo"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Notifier l'échec compte autant que le succès : après 30 min d'attente, le silence est indiscernable d'un plantage du workflow."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook rendu terminé": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Réussi et Telegram connu ?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Réussi et Telegram connu ?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Envoyer le lien",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Échec : Telegram connu ?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Échec : Telegram connu ?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Signaler l'échec",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}